<description>&lt;p&gt;Prime Minister Hun Manet is inviting former opposition lawmaker Um Sam An to a Cambodian venue for talks on disputed border claims, while Thai police arrested a suspect after three Chinese men were found bound in Tak province. Thailand launched airstrikes along the disputed Cambodia border amid rising tensions, and Singapore troops joined a ASEAN border monitoring mission in Cambodia. A Filipina trafficking victim with stage IV breast cancer was repatriated from Thailand. The conflict caused 35 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Star&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixwFBVV95cUxPVldyZnp1TFlCQUFSNVJqRFJxdmM2VFVzeC1qejd1UzhqRHZ1d0xXYl9vV21mQ1A3QjlTYi1qdmZyNEd2aGMzNENTbkFYY3p5RTJGbE1RbDlJQnJzMUJ4enc3bUJidTQ0d2E1RUt4dzYzeE5DemdnWHlLcWQ1ZGdMNVdPUkszU1JhTTJFX0V5SmpyenMwNXVBM19UQkVjUktZSmNXY3hnbTFsRGFURVdVZWxCX0txWFRpSzkzaVRpeExYWGlZVzh3?oc=5&quot;&gt;Pattaya Mail&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;NST Online&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiZEFVX3lxTE55aHlpN1FKY0pVaWxpUGZWalBCQ2VqczVMdzNZX012WnJNSmxGaEdKTjJjSnhOeTluLVEyU3YzV2ZjVGY4ZzV2X0ZFTUVvamM5aVc1OWdyUjJvOFMxRTRKYVhZV20?oc=5&quot;&gt;Nation Thailand&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinwFBVV95cUxQVExkQzhWdVY5XzJUR1RKS08tSUw3c3hZa09ubk15V2RiU3otYmVyVmlTMDV6TnRDeDlhZHphX3VKNTlhdHlFaFMwRzc0T1FjV3lRbEoyeU1wc0FVaXc4MDN6dnJibVN2YURoTlhmZ0hLMUxaVnE0S1hXQ3R0WGg3eDc2SkNWaUhjZkFfaUw0eXhieEpnQS1Na1BIQWR4alU?oc=5&quot;&gt;Thaiger&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivgFBVV95cUxPMUFMa2xlRmlNSG9EaV9FMmRMdW10Yy1fQWFyclN3UmNTOTVGNXVoRWppTjJ5R0NhMHBNUnF2RFpEWS03NE5FSjBWVEliUUtzUUNCX1VGaDNjaV9LenI2M1ZyTVRHcG9KU0hEVlBCUnZoWlNQbVVtd0ppa0NCWXNJbktv